d, N . Arch - Int, C . So - In, and A . Chanlun . ( 2017 ). Estrus Prediction in Dairy Cows using Fuzzy Logic . The 13th National Conference on Computing and Information Technology ( NCCIT 2017 ). Arnoma Grand Bangkok Hotel, July 6 - 7, 2017 . P . Chotnasiaw, W . Songpan, S . Arch - Int, and S . Saiyod . ( 2017 ). Analysis of Affecting Factors to Customer Reviews Using Opinion Mining . The 13th National Conference on Computing and Information Technology ( NCCIT 2017 ) , Arnoma Grand Bangkok Hotel, July 6 - 7, 2017 . N . Thanomsieng, N . Boonruam, P . Sirisawat, W . Nonsakhoo and S . Saiyod . ( 2017 ). Landscape Analysis System using 3D Stereoscopic for Drone . IEEE 13th International Colloquium on Signal Processing & Its Applications ( CSPA2017 ). Penang, Malaysia, May 10 - 12, 2018 . W . Nonsakhoo, P . Sirisawat, S . Saiyod, and N . Benjamas . ( 2017 ). Angle of Arrival Estimation by using Stereo Ultrasonic Technique for Local Positioning System . 2017 IEEE 13th International Colloquium on Signal Processing & Its Applications ( CSPA2017 ). Penang, Malaysia, May 10 - 12, 2018 . P . Ueareeworakul and Saiyan Saiyod . (2017). Obstacle detection algorithm for unmanned aerial vehicles using binocular stereoscopic vision . The 2017- 9 th International Conference on Knowledge and Smart Technology ( KST ). Amari Hotel, Pattaya, Chonburi, Thailand . ภาระงานสอน ระดับปริญญาตรี 322 391 Research Methodology 322 479 Introduction to Information Technology Professional 342 117 Structured Programming for Information Technology 342 118 Object Oriented Concepts and Programming 342 162 Introduction to Computer Organization and Architecture 342 224 Digital Logic and Embedded Systems ระดับปริญญาโท 322 744 Computer Network Administration 322 793 Research Methodology 322 891 Seminar in Information Technology I 322 892 Seminar in Information Technology II 322 899 Thesis 322 897 Independent Study ระดับปริญญาเอก 322 999 Doctoral Dissertation\nสายยัญ สายยศ Saiyan Saiyod ผู้ช่วยศาสตราจารย์ Assi